  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "A magnitude six point four earthquake just",
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 2.205
    },
    {
      "text": "struck the South Pacific!",
      "start": 2.205,
      "end": 3.372
    },
    {
      "text": "But not on Easter Island.",
      "start": 3.412,
      "end": 4.49
    },
    {
      "text": "It hit about fifteen hundred kilometers",
      "start": 4.79,
      "end": 6.679
    },
    {
      "text": "southeast, in the open ocean.",
      "start": 6.679,
      "end": 8.259
    },
    {
      "text": "A shallow quake on October twenty-ninth,",
      "start": 8.299,
      "end": 10.436
    },
    {
      "text": "far from any town.",
      "start": 10.436,
      "end": 11.469
    },
    {
      "text": "USGS issued a green alert,",
      "start": 11.509,
      "end": 13.508
    },
    {
      "text": "estimating no populated areas were exposed",
      "start": 13.508,
      "end": 15.673
    },
    {
      "text": "to shaking.",
      "start": 15.673,
      "end": 16.203
    },
    {
      "text": "No tsunami warnings or damage have",
      "start": 16.243,
      "end": 17.889
    },
    {
      "text": "been reported.",
      "start": 17.889,
      "end": 18.491
    },
    {
      "text": "Why here?",
      "start": 18.531,
      "end": 19.125
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the Chile Rise,",
      "start": 19.196,
      "end": 20.329
    },
    {
      "text": "where the Nazca and Antarctic plates",
      "start": 20.329,
      "end": 22.029
    },
    {
      "text": "pull apart.",
      "start": 22.029,
      "end": 22.643
    },
    {
      "text": "USGS data show this fault slipped sideways.",
      "start": 22.683,
      "end": 25.123
    },
    {
      "text": "Nearly the same spot hit six point",
      "start": 25.163,
      "end": 26.882
    },
    {
      "text": "seven in twenty twenty-one.",
      "start": 26.882,
      "end": 28.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow Next Huge Quake for verified",
      "start": 28.34,
      "end": 30.316
    },
    {
      "text": "earthquake news.",
      "start": 30.316,
      "end": 31.243
    }
  ],
